<Pnumber>2</Pnumber>
<P1para>
<P2 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/uksi/2026/555/article/2/1/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2026/555/article/2/1" id="article-2-1">
<Pnumber>1</Pnumber>
<P2para>
<Text>The Excise Duties (Surcharges or Rebates) (Hydrocarbon Oils etc.) (Temporary Continuation of 2022 Order and Adjustments) Order 2026<FootnoteRef Ref="f00003"/> is amended as follows.</Text>
</P2para>
</P2>
<P2 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/uksi/2026/555/article/2/2/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2026/555/article/2/2" id="article-2-2">
<Pnumber>2</Pnumber>
<P2para>
<Text>In article 1—</Text>
<P3 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/uksi/2026/555/article/2/2/a/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2026/555/article/2/2/a" id="article-2-2-a">
<Pnumber>a</Pnumber>
<P3para>
<Text>in paragraph (2), for “31st August 2026” substitute <InlineAmendment>“31st December 2026”</InlineAmendment>;</Text>
</P3para>
</P3>
<P3 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/uksi/2026/555/article/2/2/b/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2026/555/article/2/2/b" id="article-2-2-b">
<Pnumber>b</Pnumber>
<P3para>
<Text>omit paragraph (3);</Text>
</P3para>
</P3>
<P3 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/uksi/2026/555/article/2/2/c/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2026/555/article/2/2/c" id="article-2-2-c">
<Pnumber>c</Pnumber>
<P3para>
<Text>in paragraph (4), for “1st December 2026” substitute <InlineAmendment>“1st January 2027”</InlineAmendment>.</Text>
</P3para>
</P3>
</P2para>
</P2>
<P2 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/uksi/2026/555/article/2/3/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2026/555/article/2/3" id="article-2-3">
<Pnumber>3</Pnumber>
<P2para>
<Text>In article 3, for “31st August 2026” substitute <InlineAmendment>“31st December 2026”</InlineAmendment>.</Text>
</P2para>
</P2>
<P2 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/uksi/2026/555/article/2/4/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2026/555/article/2/4" id="article-2-4">
<Pnumber>4</Pnumber>
<P2para>
<Text>Omit articles 4 to 7.</Text>
</P2para>
</P2>
<P2 DocumentURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/uksi/2026/555/article/2/5/made" IdURI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2026/555/article/2/5" id="article-2-5">
<Pnumber>5</Pnumber>
<P2para>
<Text>In articles 8 to 11, in each of the headings, for “1st December 2026” substitute <InlineAmendment>“1st January 2027”</InlineAmendment>.</Text>
</P2para>
</P2>
</P1para>
